---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: SELECT a FROM t WHERE CAST(c AS INT) = a AND CAST(c AS INT) = a AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM u WHERE u.a = t.a AND u.a = t.a)
---
Project [a#0]
+- Filter ((CAST(c#2 AS INT) == a#0) and exists)
   :  +- Project [1 AS 1#5]
   :     +- Filter (a#3 == outer(a#0))
   :        +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3]
   +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, c#2]
